{
  "id": "083",
  "title": "Withdrawing Money",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2016-03-01",
  "synopsis": "Today’s lesson is a funny story about a man being laughed at when he tries to withdraw money at an ATM. But why is he being laughed at?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/75/c44ca003e2da06f22bee1a1dd3a6c58ac86db333.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "取钱\n\n    昨天，我去ATM取钱。站在我后面的人一直在看我。\n    我很生气地问他：“你看什么看呀！”\n    后面的人笑着说：“我只是想看看你不用银行卡，用身份证能取出什么钱来。”",
    "traditional": "取錢\n\n    昨天，我去ATM取錢。站在我後面的人一直在看我。\n    我很生氣地問他：“你看什麼看呀！”\n    後面的人笑著說：“我只是想看看你不用銀行卡，用身份證能取出什麼錢來。”"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Withdrawing Money"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "昨天，我去ATM取钱。",
      "traditional": "昨天，我去ATM取錢。",
      "pinyin": "zuó tiān wǒ qù 3 qǔ qián",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "站在我后面的人一直在看我。",
      "traditional": "站在我後面的人一直在看我。",
      "pinyin": "zhàn zài wǒ hòu miàn de rén yì zhí zài kàn wǒ",
      "english": "Yesterday, I went to the ATM to withdraw money."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Standing behind me was a man who was constantly looking at me."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "我很生气地问他：“你看什么看呀！”",
      "traditional": "我很生氣地問他：“你看什麼看呀！”",
      "pinyin": "wǒ hěn shēng qì de wèn tā nǐ kàn shén me kàn ya",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I asked him angrily: “What are you looking at!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "后面的人笑着说：“我只是想看看你不用银行卡，用身份证能取出什么钱来。”",
      "traditional": "後面的人笑著說：“我只是想看看你不用銀行卡，用身份證能取出什麼錢來。”",
